WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.753
Your company runs on software. Why does modern software feel like an expensive, sluggish tax on your team's sanity?

2
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:17.813
Meet the Local Craft Suite. Fifty-two native applications written in pure, zero-panic Rust, with single-file SQLite databases and zero cloud dependencies.

3
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:29.188
No webhooks. No Zapier. Pure atomic file synchronization via the Craft Domino Bus. When your team acts, the entire enterprise aligns.

4
00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:40.003
Thirteen core back-office applications cover accounting, invoicing, contracts, HR, and asset tracking with Austrian ebInterface and SEPA compliance out of the box.

5
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:51.753
Now expanded with the Shop Craft Commerce Suite: WebShopCraft, ShopCraft, and AmazonShopCraft, bridging brick-and-mortar POS, web storefronts, and marketplace inventory.

6
00:00:53.800 --> 00:01:01.123
Plus thirty-five specialized DIY, studio, and vertical craft apps, all sharing the same fast native interface and local data ownership.

7
00:01:03.100 --> 00:01:08.634
Zero recurring subscriptions. Forever yours. Welcome to local-first software.
